  "description": "Reads image metadata (EXIF with MakerNotes, IPTC, XMP, ICC profiles, comments, previews) from JPEG, PNG, WebP, TIFF, DNG, TIFF-based raw files, HEIC/HEIF/AVIF, PSD, JPEG 2000, EXV, CR3, JPEG XL and XMP sidecars, and edits it without decoding or recompressing image data. An independent implementation measured against exiv2. Fully managed; depends only on MetadataSharp.Core.",
